            <line x1="232" y1="102" x2="255" y2="102" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.3"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Publish as you go, not before you begin</h3>
        <p>The old full-course workbooks were dread-inducing to create and maintain. We prefer to create and adapt as we go now.</p>
      </div>

